It is built from source into per-backend wheels, rather than installed from a
vendor&amp;rsquo;s wheel.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FlagCX</title><link>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flagcx/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flagcx/</guid><description>&lt;!--
