&lt;p&gt;FlagGems is the operator library vLLM runs on in FlagOS images. It is shipped
three ways, split by the one fact that matters — the &lt;code&gt;flag_gems&lt;/code&gt; package is
pure Python, the C++ operator library is not:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FlagLibs</title><link>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flaglibs/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flaglibs/</guid><description>&lt;!--
